# Keep the Docker build context small. Image builds copy only what they need
# (see harness/Dockerfile); everything heavy or irrelevant is excluded.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
operator/bin
effector/bin
operator/testbin
poc
tmp
**/*.log
# The docs bundle that `docs:build` writes into @jr2/orchestrator (ADR-0072): it is for an Instance's
# Assistant, in the package npm serves, and the Orchestrator image never reads it. Dropped from the
# context, so a local docs:build changes neither the image nor its tag (build.ts KIT_ORCHESTRATOR_EXCLUDE).
packages/orchestrator/**/docs
packages/agent-protocol/**/docs
deploy/orchestrator/**/docs
**/.env
